msgstr "Puertas clásicas {#classical-gates}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**NOT Gate**\n"
msgstr "**Puerta NOT**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The NOT gate, also known as the Pauli X gate, flips the "
"$\\left|0\\right\\rangle$ state to $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$, and vice "
"versa. The NOT gate is equivalent to RX for the angle $\\pi$ or to ‘HZH’.\n"
msgstr ""
"La puerta NOT, también conocida como puerta Pauli X, invierte el estado "
"$\\left|0\\right\\rangle$ a $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$, y viceversa. La "
"puerta NOT es equivalente a RX para el ángulo $\\pi$ o a 'HZH'.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Composer reference                                | OpenQASM reference | Q-sphere | Note about q-sphere representations                                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n"
