# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Toffoli gate**\n"
msgstr "**Puerta Toffoli**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Toffoli gate, also known as the double controlled-NOT gate (CCX), has "
"two control qubits and one target. It applies a NOT to the target only when "
"both controls are in state $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""
"La puerta Toffoli, también conocida como puerta NOT controlado doble (CCX), "
"tiene dos qubits de control y uno objetivo. Aplica un NOT al objetivo solo "
"cuando ambos controles están en el estado $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Toffoli gate with the Hadamard gate is a universal gate set for quantum "
"computing.\n"
msgstr ""
"La puerta Toffoli junto con la puerta Hadamard forman un conjunto universal "
"de puertas para la computación cuántica.\n"

