# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**T gate**\n"
msgstr "**Puerta T**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The T gate is equivalent to RZ for the angle $\\pi/4$. Fault-tolerant "
"quantum computers will compile all quantum programs down to just the T gate "
"and its inverse, as well as the Clifford gates.\n"
msgstr ""
"La puerta T es equivalente a RZ para el ángulo $\\pi/4$. Las computadoras "
"cuánticas tolerantes a fallos compilarán todos los programas cuánticos hacia"
" solo la puerta T y su inversa, así como las puertas de Clifford.\n"

