# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**S gate**\n"
msgstr "**Puerta S**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The S gate applies a phase of $i$ to the $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$ state. It"
" is equivalent to RZ for the angle $\\pi/2$. Note that S=P($\\pi/2$).\n"
msgstr ""
"La puerta S aplica una fase de $i$ al estado $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$. Es "
"equivalente a RZ para el ángulo $\\pi/2$. Ten en cuenta que S=P($\\pi/2$).\n"

