# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Phase gate**\n"
msgstr "**Puerta de fase**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Phase gate (previously called the U1 gate) applies a phase of "
"$e^{i\\theta}$ to the $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$ state. For certain values of"
" $\\theta$, it is equivalent to other gates. For example, P($\\pi$)=Z, "
"P($\\pi$/$2$)=S, and P($\\pi/4$)=T. Up to a global phase of "
"$e^{i\\theta/2}$, it is equivalent to RZ($\\theta$).\n"
msgstr ""
"La puerta de fase (anteriormente llamada puerta U1) aplica una fase de "
"$e^{i\\theta}$ al estado $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$. Para ciertos valores de "
"$\\theta$, es equivalente a otras puertas. Por ejemplo, P($\\pi$)=Z, "
"P($\\pi$/$2$)=S, y P($\\pi/4$)=T. Salvo una fase global de $e^{i\\theta/2}$,"
" es equivalente a RZ($\\theta$).\n"

