# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Hadamard gate {#hadamard-gate}"
msgstr "Puerta Hadamard {#hadamard-gate}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**H gate**\n"
msgstr "**Puerta H**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The H, or Hadamard, gate rotates the states $\\left|0\\right\\rangle$ and "
"$\\left|1\\right\\rangle$ to $\\left|+\\right\\rangle$ and "
"$\\left|-\\right\\rangle$, respectively. It is useful for making "
"superpositions. If you have a universal gate set on a classical computer and"
" add the Hadamard gate, it becomes a universal gate set on a quantum "
"computer.\n"
msgstr ""
"La puerta H, o puerta Hadamard, rota los estados $\\left|0\\right\\rangle$ y"
" $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$ a $\\left|+\\right\\rangle$ y "
"$\\left|-\\right\\rangle$, respectivamente. Es útil para hacer "
"superposiciones. Si tienes un conjunto universal de puertas en una "
"computadora clásica y agregas la puerta Hadamard, se convierte en un "
"conjunto universal de puertas en una computadora cuántica.\n"

