"| ![u\\_gate](/docs/images/guides/composer/628ae112-fcf8-4be7-a04b-568c390f7c4d.avif) | `u(theta, phi, lam) q[0];` | ![u3\\_qsph](/docs/images/guides/composer/3e5212aa-a78c-48d8-b49a-4af362e5b899.avif)                            | The q-sphere representation shows the state after the gate operates on the initial equal superposition state $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2^{n}}}\\sum_{i=0}^{2^{n}-1}\\vert i\\rangle, $ where $n$ is the number of qubits needed to support the gate. |\n"
msgstr ""
