# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**RCCX gate**\n"
msgstr "**Puerta RCCX**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The simplified Toffoli gate, also referred to as Margolus gate.\n"
msgstr ""
"La puerta Toffoli simplificada, también denominada puerta de Margolus.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The simplified Toffoli gate implements the Toffoli gate up to relative "
"phases. This implementation requires three CX gates, which is the minimal "
"amount possible, as shown in https://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/0312225. Note "
"that the simplified Toffoli is not equivalent to the Toffoli, but can be "
"used in places where the Toffoli gate is uncomputed again.\n"
msgstr ""
"La puerta Toffoli simplificada implementa la puerta Toffoli salvo fases "
"relativas. Esta implementación requiere tres puertas CX, que es la cantidad "
"mínima posible, como se muestra en https://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/0312225. "
"Ten en cuenta que el Toffoli simplificado no es equivalente al Toffoli, pero"
" se puede usar en lugares donde la puerta Toffoli se descomputa "
"nuevamente.\n"

